cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tickmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Tickmark: Auditing Whether Spreadsheet Agents Build Real Financial Models"
abstract: >-
  Tickmark is a benchmark that checks whether AI spreadsheet agents build live,
  auditable financial models rather than only producing the right numbers. It
  recalculates each submitted workbook in Excel or LibreOffice, changes its inputs,
  and audits formula coverage, traceability to declared inputs and hidden
  hardcoded values against a reference model, on 35 financial-model cases.
